    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17680,
        "title": "Instance-instance",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 149925,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mari lihat bagaimana class memungkinkan kita membuat banyak objek game yang serupa pada awalnya, lalu mengubahnya satu per satu seiring waktu.</p><p>Kita akan melakukannya dengan mengamati lebih dekat para pemain dalam game yang dibuat dari class awal.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 149926,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Setiap kali kita membuat objek dari sebuah class, kita sedang membuat sesuatu yang disebut <strong>instance</strong> dari class tersebut.</p><p>Buat instance dari class <code>Player</code> dan simpan di dalam konstanta <code>player1</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option startIndex=\"108\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option startIndex=\"116\" endIndex=\"117\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Arya&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player1);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>new</code>, diikuti oleh <code>Player</code>, lalu <code>(</code>, <code>\"Arya\"</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 149927,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Setiap instance bersifat independen. Artinya, saat kita membuat instance baru, instance tersebut <em>tidak</em> memengaruhi instance lainnya.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Arya&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bran&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player1);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player2);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"118\" endIndex=\"131\" /><option startIndex=\"132\" endIndex=\"133\" /><option startIndex=\"134\" endIndex=\"153\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>const player2</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>new Player(\"Bran\");</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 149928,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><em>Mengubah</em> sebuah instance juga tidak memengaruhi instance lainnya.</p><p>Atur <code>player1.health</code> ke <code>0</code> untuk melihat bagaimana mengubah properti dari <code>player1</code> tidak memengaruhi properti <code>player2</code>.<br /></p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"135\" endIndex=\"136\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Arya&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player1.health = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player1);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bran&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player2);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 149929,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Karena setiap instance bersifat independen, kita bisa melacak data yang rumit seperti sejumlah besar musuh dalam game.<br /></p><p>Dalam contoh ini, kita melacak empat pemain dan kesehatan mereka. Game sungguhan mungkin melacak ratusan objek.<br /></p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Arya&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bran&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player3 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sansa&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player4 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player1);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player2);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player3);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player4);\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 149930,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ketika merujuk pada instance sebuah class, apa yang sedang kita bicarakan?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Objek game tertentu yang dibuat dari template class</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Template class yang digunakan untuk membuat objek game</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Objek game tertentu yang dibuat dari template class.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 149931,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Berapa banyak instance yang bisa kita buat dari sebuah class?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sebanyak yang kita mau</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hanya satu</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sebanyak yang kita mau.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 149932,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jika kita mengubah properti sebuah instance, apa yang akan terjadi pada instance lain yang dibuat dari class yang sama?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tidak ada, keduanya tidak saling terhubung</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Semua instance memiliki propertinya yang diubah</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Tidak ada, keduanya tidak saling terhubung.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 149933,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jika kita mengubah properti sebuah instance, apa yang akan terjadi pada class tempat instance tersebut dibuat?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tidak ada, hanya instance-nya yang akan berubah</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Properti class juga akan berubah</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Tidak ada, hanya instance-nya yang akan berubah.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 149934,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat instance dari class <code>Enemy</code> dan simpan di konstanta <code>slime</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"128\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(type, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".type = type;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" slime = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy(\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(slime);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>new</code>, diikuti oleh <code>Enemy</code>, dan terakhir <code>(\"slime\", 30)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 149935,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat instance dari class <code>Enemy</code> dan simpan dalam konstanta <code>goblin</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"145\" endIndex=\"148\" /><option startIndex=\"149\" endIndex=\"154\" /><option startIndex=\"154\" endIndex=\"168\" /><option startIndex=\"168\" endIndex=\"169\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(type, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".type = type;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" slime = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy(\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" goblin = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy(\" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(slime);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(goblin);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>new</code>, diikuti oleh <code>Enemy</code>, lalu <code>(\"goblin\", 50)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 149936,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Atur <code>slime.health</code> menjadi setengah dari nilainya.<br /></p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"190\" endIndex=\"202\" /><option startIndex=\"203\" endIndex=\"204\" /><option startIndex=\"205\" endIndex=\"217\" /><option startIndex=\"218\" endIndex=\"222\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(type, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".type = type;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" slime = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy(\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(slime);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" goblin = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy(\" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"slime.health = slime.health / \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(goblin);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>slime.health</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, lalu <code>slime.health</code>, <code>/ 2;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 149937,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan jenis musuh lain.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"170\" endIndex=\"175\" /><option startIndex=\"176\" endIndex=\"182\" /><option startIndex=\"183\" endIndex=\"184\" /><option startIndex=\"185\" endIndex=\"188\" /><option startIndex=\"189\" endIndex=\"194\" /><option startIndex=\"194\" endIndex=\"209\" /><option startIndex=\"209\" endIndex=\"210\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(type, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".type = type;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" slime = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy(\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" goblin = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy(\" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" dragon = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy(\" /><text value=\"&quot;dragon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"300\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(slime);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(goblin);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(dragon);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>const</code>, diikuti oleh <code>dragon</code>, lalu <code>=</code>, <code>new</code>, <code>Enemy</code>, <code>(\"dragon\", 300)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
