            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apakah kode ini akan berjalan jika class tidak memiliki constructor?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"GameLoop\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" start() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game running&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" loop = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" GameLoop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"loop.start();\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ya, karena menggunakan konstruktor default</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Itu tidak dapat berjalan tanpa constructor</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ya, karena menggunakan konstruktor default.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 149947,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ubah <code>points</code> dari <code>pickup1</code> dan <code>pickup2</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"155\" endIndex=\"175\" /><option startIndex=\"176\" endIndex=\"196\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Pickup\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".points = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pickup1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Pickup(\" /><text value=\"&quot;GoldCoin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pickup2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Pickup(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Gem&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pickup1.points = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pickup2.points = \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(pickup1);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(pickup2);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>pickup1.points = 10;</code>, diikuti oleh <code>pickup2.points = 50;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 149948,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan properti <code>rarity</code> agar semua pickup dimulai dengan kelangkaan yang sama.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"93\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Pickup\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".points = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".rarity = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pickup1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Pickup(\" /><text value=\"&quot;GoldCoin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pickup2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Pickup(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Gem&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(pickup1.rarity);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(pickup2.rarity);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>this</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, lalu <code>rarity</code>, <code>=</code>, <code>1;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 149949,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Panggil metode <code>collect()</code> yang baru ditambahkan dan merupakan bagian dari class <code>Pickup</code> untuk melihat bagaimana semua instance <code>Pickup</code> dapat menggunakannya.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".collect;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"313\" endIndex=\"324\" /><option startIndex=\"332\" endIndex=\"343\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Pickup\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".points = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".rarity = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".total = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" collect() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".total += \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".points;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pickup1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Pickup(\" /><text value=\"&quot;GoldCoin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pickup2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Pickup(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Gem&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pickup1.points = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pickup2.points = \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pickup1.collect();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pickup2.collect();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>.collect();</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.collect();</code>.</p></body></html>"
